{"step_index":95,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:47:19Z","thinking":"**Examining Independent Set Bound**\n\nConsider the lemma `indep_card_le_edge_cover_card`, aiming to prove the cardinality of an independent set is less than or equal to the cardinality of an edge cover. This involves comparing the sizes of `I` (independent set) and `s` (edge cover). The approach likely involves constructing a mapping or relating edges in the edge cover to vertices in the independent set.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen Finset SimpleGraph\n\nlemma sym2_eq_of_ne_mem {V : Type*} [DecidableEq V] (u v : V) (e : Sym2 V)\n    (hu : u ∈ e) (hv : v ∈ e) (hne : u ≠ v) : e = s(u, v) := by\n  induction e using Sym2.inductionOn with\n  | hf a b =>\n    rw [Sym2.mem_iff] at hu hv\n    rcases hu with rfl | rfl <;> rcases hv with rfl | rfl\n    · contradiction\n    · rfl\n    · exact Sym2.eq_swap\n    · contradiction\n\nlemma indep_card_le_edge_cover_card {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (I : Finset V) (hI : GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G I)\n    (s : Finset (Sym2 V)) (hs_sub : s ⊆ G.edgeFinset) (hs_cov : GraphCalc.IsEdgeCoverFinset G s) :\n    I.card ≤ s.card := by\n  let f : V → Sym2 V := fun v => Classical.choose (hs_cov v)\n  have hf_spec : ∀ v, f v ∈ s ∧ v ∈ f v := fun v => Classical.choose_spec (hs_cov v)\n  have hmaps : Set.MapsTo f (↑I) (↑s) := by\n    intro v _\n    exact (hf_spec v).1\n  have hinj : Set.InjOn f (↑I) := by\n    intro u hu v hv heq\n    by_contra hne\n    have hu_e : u ∈ f u := (hf_spec u).2\n    have hv_e : v ∈ f u := by rw [heq]; exact (hf_spec v).2\n    have he_eq : f u = s(u, v) := sym2_eq_of_ne_mem u v (f u) hu_e hv_e hne\n    have he_in_s : f u ∈ s := (hf_spec u).1\n    have he_in_edges : f u ∈ G.edgeFinset := hs_sub he_in_s\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeFinset] at he_in_edges\n    rw [he_eq] at he_in_edges\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeSet] at he_in_edges\n    have h_not_adj : ¬ G.Adj u v := hI u hu v hv\n    exact h_not_adj he_in_edges\n  exact Finset.card_le_card_of_injOn f hmaps hinj\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\n","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_1facfd37","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Testing indep_card_le_edge_cover_card in scratch.lean","toolSummary":"Test core lemma in scratch.lean"}}]}
